commit 3d004f6b7a3e6a344aa44dc73eb29ed6919b119d
Author: Ali Mohamed Ali <someguyshutup5@gmail.com>
Date:   Tue Jun 9 23:11:31 2026 +0300

    Patch no.7 Added support for dynamic loading of asset folders
    
    Wawacraft:Evolved loads its assets from a giant folder with assets as
    subdirectories.  For this, the feature of being able to load from different
    places has been given.
    
    - Allows for loading files from multiple root paths, including local, installed
    - Installs a default package data folder /usr/local/share/wawacraft-evolved
    - Added an option --root that allows one to specify where to load assets from.
    - Added a new feature to flags that allows one to arbitrarily execute based on settings,
      previous flags were only numeric and used 'translation tables' that assigned to
      specific settings in classes.

