    Updated logging system announcement of control flow
    
    So usually in the codebase, there's a pattern of classes creating a
    log object and then calling the logging::log::record function.  I decided to
    embed that into the constructor optionally. Now it can have a default enter
    announcement, or you may announce your control flow with a special message,
    or you may forego announcement altogether (such as in functions that run at
    every iteration).
    
