    which were especially proving hard to work with for some time. Glad I
    did it, because I spotted a bug to take out during the matrix multiplication.
    Previously, I made some insomnia-induced bad code that made vertex(homogenous)
    dot products for the matrices, and whilst that is mathematically and
    conceptually exactly what ur supposed to do, I forgot the older implementation
    had the 'proper' implementation using for-loops.
    
