commit 6a6a6edef755615a3a9ae97f7ad844c0b651e5d5
Author: sphurlsmith <sphurlsmith@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Nov 15 18:57:00 2024 +0300

    Fixed up vertical rotation
    
    It works!! Code is absolutely horrid, and we need
    to fix the cursed boots of Wawacraft Evolved.
    
    Two types of cursed-boot bugs come up:
    
    - Altered rotation such that horizontal rotation is
      just completely off the hook fast
    - Horizontal rotation just disappears sometimes
      and in these boots you always end west of the
      block facing north. (this is most probably because
      the rotation is just cursed on boot so awfully that
      it can't even make the initial rotation somehow)
    
    I suppose there are 2 main reasons why this bug happens:
    
    Either some initial thing is happening with the target
    vector's numbers such that no horizontal multiplication works on
    them. Or the rotation is being cancelled out by something
    greater. We know in the other half of boots that the
    rotation can work fine, so I'm definitely considering that
    its some kind of race condition.
    
    WAWACRAFT EVOLVED FOREVER!!!!!!!!!!!!

