    HORIZONTAL ROTATION WORKS
    
    AFTER WEEKS... WEEKS OF EFFORT. I FINALLY DID IT!! YESS! I
    FOUND THE SECRET!!!!! THANK YOU GOD !!!! THANK YOU GOD !!!
    
